{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1415.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"d5ffc4d6233fbbe68df50422ca45da1f15451644d83084649dd61d9bfa0d00c5","ja":"今日のお仕事は、雑誌の取材。\nインタビューは順調に進んでいて……","zh":"今天的工作是杂志采访。\n采访进行得很顺利……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1415.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"64558878209321cc6f8f355d361d90339e3a167e41a10ed346805fa6ee4fd7da","ja":"「……最後に、公演は今後も続いていくと思いますが、\n見所を教えてください」","zh":"“……最后，公演今后也还会继续下去，\n请问有什么看点呢？”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1415.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7f2430d9a7f854b5d6ec74199daff093bd59a88c9dd33f5c73f1e8a75ba75bbb","ja":"あの、わたしからいいですか？\n今後の展開は、まだ知らないんですけど……。","zh":"那个，可以先由我说吗？\n之后的展开，我虽然还不知道……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
